"Firebird Structures is not likely to prevail on its two claims asserting tortious interference with contractual relations, because Firebird Structures' LMRA {\S} 303 claim, 29 U.S.C. {\S} 187, preempts those claims" (\href{zotero://open-pdf/library/items/DAD4ZPVI?page=11}{ 2017:11})
\par
"On March 30, 2017, in state court, Firebird Structures filed its Original Complaint. In the Original Complaint, Firebird Structures alleged claims for: (i) tortious interference with existing contractual damages, see Original Complaint {\P}{\P} 15-20, at 3; (ii) intentional interference with prospective contractual relations, see Original Complaint {\P}{\P} 21-27, at 3-4; (iii) prima facie tort, see Original Complaint {\P}{\P} 28-33, at 4; and (iv) injunctive relief," (\href{zotero://open-pdf/library/items/DAD4ZPVI?page=14}{ 2017:14})
\par
