\par
"Also, on March 31, 2017, the Southwest Regional Council of Carpenters, of which the Carpenters' Union is a local affiliate, filed with the National Labor Relations Board ("NLRB") a Charge Against Employer against Firebird Structures, alleging that Firebird Structures "interfered with, restrained and coerced its employees in the exercise of the rights guaranteed by the [National Labor Relations Act]." NLRB Charge Against Employer at 1." (\href{zotero://open-pdf/library/items/DAD4ZPVI?page=15}{ 2017:15})
