\par
"NCR Corp., 313 N.L.R.B. 574, 576 (1993) ("The right of employees to distribute union literature during nonworktime and nonwork areas is not limited only to distribution to prospective union members. Employees have a statutorily protected right to solicit sympathy, if not support, from the general public, customers, supervisors, or members of other labor organizations.");" (\href{zotero://open-pdf/library/items/JLKIKWFV?page=6}{ 2003:6})},
