\par
``if a lawyer is appointed, he or she must fulfill the responsibilities of the guardian ad litem in a manner that is consistent with the requirements of the Rules of Professional Conduct.'' (\href{zotero://select/library/items/EDWCZHYH}{``2002 Formal Ethics Opinion 8: Direct Contact with Lawyer Appointed Guardian Ad Litem for Minor Plaintiff'', 2003, p. 1})},
